                  "content": "# Custom order-triage runtime\n\n`createOrderTriageAgent` in `/src/order-triage-agent.ts` is the custom-runtime factory for the `order-triage` agent. It awaits the runtime-supplied canonical instruction loader with `/moldea/agents/order-triage/instruction.md`, then exposes classification for human review with refund approval disabled.\n\nThe loader implementation is supplied by the factory caller and is not defined in this repository. The repository does not establish a model provider, tools, or additional decision authority.\n",
